  id: base.quest.14
  number: 14
  title: Return to Barak Tor
  previousQuest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9bdd61ed58f82784ca7463ec68033f99, type: 2}
  parchmentText: Now that you have found the Spirit Blade, you must return to Barak
    Tor and defeat the Witch Lord. The King has ridden forth to meet the eastern
    orcs at Darkfire Pass. If you fail, the Witch Lord will lead his army of undead
    and attack His Majesty's forces from the rear. Then nothing remains to prevent
    the forces of Dread from overrunning the land!
