  - key: The Witch Lord
    trigger: 0
    roomId: 
    cell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    description: 'Use the Dread sorcerer figure for the Witch Lord. The Witch Lord
      is not affected by any weapon or spell other than the Spirit Blade. The Witch
      Lord has grown stronger! (See stats.) Also, he knows the following spells:
      summon undead, fear (which he can cast twice), ball of flame, command, and
      tempest. Refer to the Dread spell cards for details.'
    requiresDeadGroup: 
    firstHeroOnly: 1
    trapped: 0
    effects: []
    onTrapSprung: []
    onTrapDisarmed: []
  - key: If the Witch Lord is defeated
    trigger: 0
    roomId: 
    cell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    description: "If the Witch Lord is defeated, he vanishes in a puff of foul, black
      smoke. When the smoke clears, the heroes hear the tinkle of metal skittering
      across the floor. On the floor, they find an artifact\u2014the magical Spell
      Ring\u2014that the Witch Lord was wearing. Its use is explained on the matching
      artifact card.\nAfter this quest is successfully completed, all surviving heroes
      are awarded the title of \"Champion\" by the King."
    requiresDeadGroup: witch_lord
